      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SKIP TO ME LOU (7) won at this track two runs ago but couldn't repeat the dose at his latest appearance over 2138m at this track, beaten 8 metres. Tactics will be crucial from this wide draw. This is a nice drop in grade so he is sure to prove tough to beat. ALL EYES ON BLING (3) has been racing well, filling a top-five position at her last seven starts including a second most recently at this track over 2138m. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a comparable field and she can get the job done. FRANCO MACHO NZ (1) was unplaced two starts ago then things went wrong last start when he broke and finished 2.75 metres away in seventh over 2138m at this track. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Only needs to get things right to be in the money. ROCK NIEN (9) is the best of the rest after finishing fourth over 2200m at Marburg last time out.",
